  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV21</p>\n<p><strong>Total Material Cost:</strong> Cost of item being upgraded + 500eb</p>\n<p><em>An optics tweak to make the sights anti-vibration, anti-distortion, and extra anti-anything you look at through it.</em></p>\n<p>Invented Tech Upgrade. Must be installed in a Scope Weapon Attachment which provides a bonus to Single Shot Attack Checks. The Scope now provides its usual bonus to Autofire Attacks made with the weapon, as long as the Attack still meets the usual requirements for the Scope's Attack Check bonus (e.g., Sniping Scope requiring firing at a target beyond 50m/yds).</p>\n<p><strong>Invented Tech Upgrade:</strong> Upgrade DV21; total material cost: the item's cost + 500eb</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is 0 because a Tech builds this; the material cost depends on the item upgraded.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Invented Weapon Upgrades).</em></p>"
